        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0080">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">an extrusion process</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was conducted at 200° C. and a screw rotation rate of 200 rpm, to form a B layer 3  ⁇ m thick.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0080">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the A and B layers</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">were coextruded from a T-die through feed blocks, to form a laminated structure comprising three layers, that is, B layer/A layer/B layer, which was then cooled on a cooling roll, thereby forming a gel composition comprising B layer/A layer/B layer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0081">
