        <span itemprop="definition">were dry mixed with 0.5 wt % Irganox (1010, available from Ciba Geigy Co. Ltd.), serving as an antioxidant, based on the amount of the high density polyethylene, to prepare a resin composition. Then, the resin composition was loaded into a first twin-screw extruder, and paraffin oil was injected into a side feed of the twin-screw extruder using a pump. The amounts of resin composition and paraffin oil added are shown in Table 4 below. Subsequently, an extrusion process was conducted at 240° C. and a screw rotation rate of 200 rpm, to form an A layer.</span>
